WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.600
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain the American epic science fiction film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Dune.” Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:24.240
The movie Dune is set in the year 10191. Humans&nbsp;
have unfolded many secrets of the universe and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:29.040
now travel from planet to planet. Different&nbsp;
planets have turned into different nations and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:35.680
are governed by a single Padishah Emperor named&nbsp;
Shaddam Corrino IV. The planets have “houses”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:41.440
with their respective dukes who in turn follow the&nbsp;
orders of the emperor Shaddam. One of such planets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:47.600
is the planet of Arrakis. It is a harsh desert&nbsp;
planet that is the only source of a rare substance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:53.440
called "spice". Spice is a valuable substance&nbsp;
that extends human vitality and is critical for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:59.520
interstellar travel. Hence, Arrakis, despite its&nbsp;
harsh conditions, is considered the most valuable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:05.840
planet in the known universe. Because of this,&nbsp;
the noble houses are eager to rule the planet. 
&nbsp;

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:10.800
At the beginning of the movie, a native of the&nbsp;
Arrakis named Chani narrates that they have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:16.320
ruled by the noble House Harkonnen for a long&nbsp;
time. The House Harkonnen is cruel to natives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:21.040
of Arrakis but the poor natives cannot fight&nbsp;
House Harkonnen which is under the emperor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:26.640
Shaddam’s control. Chani also says that one&nbsp;
day, all of a sudden, House Harkonnen’s troops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.840
leave Arrakis. But she is sure that the&nbsp;
emperor is going to send someone else to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:37.360
take their place and exploit their resources.
The scene then changes to another planet named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:43.680
Caladan ruled by House Atreides. The prince of&nbsp;
Atreides, Paul wakes up from a recurring dream. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.720
has breakfast with his mother Lady Jessica who is&nbsp;
also a member of an organization called the Bene&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:54.160
Gesserit. Bene Gesserit is an exclusive sisterhood&nbsp;
organization whose members have advanced physical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:59.440
and mental abilities. Hence, Jessica also&nbsp;
has the power to manipulate people’s minds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:05.120
She has been training Paul the organization’s&nbsp;
disciplines for a long time. Thus, Paul has powers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:10.960
to see the future and bears other unique powers&nbsp;
that he is yet to discover. Paul’s father Leto,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.200
who is also the duke of House Atreides, has&nbsp;
an important meeting with personnel from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.400
Landsraad, the political body representing all&nbsp;
the noble houses. In the evening, everyone in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:26.240
Atreides welcomes the VIPs who have brought a note&nbsp;
from the emperor Shaddam himself. The emperor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:31.120
who has recently removed House Harkonnen from&nbsp;
the Arrakis, wants Atreides to take Harkonnen’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:37.200
place. He wants Leto and his troops to be in&nbsp;
charge of mining the “spice” from Arrakis. 
&nbsp;

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:42.320
Duke Leto is apprehensive of the situation&nbsp;
but follows the emperor’s orders. Whilst&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:48.080
in the meeting, Jessica notices a member of the&nbsp;
Bene Gesserit organization, Gaius Helen Mohiam,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:53.040
staring at Paul. The meeting ends when Leto&nbsp;
marks a seal with his ring, confirming that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:58.800
they will follow the orders and go to Arrakis. 
In the following scene, we see Atreides's troops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:04.640
preparing to leave for Arrakis. Among the troop&nbsp;
is their bravest soldier named Duncan who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:09.680
also Paul’s close friend. Paul has been getting&nbsp;
visions about Duncan’s death in Arrakis which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:14.720
he is worried about. Duncan assures him that he&nbsp;
will be fine and leaves for the planet to prepare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:20.080
for Paul and the family’s arrival. The following&nbsp;
scene shows us Paul and his father Leto talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:25.440
about various matters. Leto reveals that he has&nbsp;
no interest in gaining wealth using the spice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:29.600
instead, he plans on befriending the&nbsp;
people of Arrakis called the Fremen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.600
Unlike the former duke, Harkonnen, he&nbsp;
plans to treat the Fremen with respect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:39.600
so they can be a valuable asset to Atreides. 
Later, Paul and his associate, Halleck practice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:45.120
a duel. They have a wrist device that creates&nbsp;
a layer of protective force around their body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:49.200
Halleck is worried that they will be attacked&nbsp;
by the jealous Harkonnen, so he asks Paul to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:54.480
be careful when they reach Arrakis. Elsewhere,&nbsp;
in the house of Harkonnen the former ruler of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.480 --> 00:04:00.320
Arrakis, duke Baron and his rogue nephew Rabban&nbsp;
talk about their last ship leaving the Arrakis,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.880
leaving the planet to the Atreides. Rabban&nbsp;
belittles the emperor for taking them off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:10.560
Arrakis and handing it to the Atreides. But he&nbsp;
is surprised when Baron reveals that the emperor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:15.840
is actually planning on the Atreides’s downfall&nbsp;
because he is jealous of their growing popularity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:21.840
The emperor’s plan is to kill Leto and all his&nbsp;
men when they are mining spice in Arrakis. 
&nbsp;

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:26.160
Back in the Caladan, Jessica wakes Paul&nbsp;
up and takes him to a doctor to get his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:31.040
vitals checked. It turns out that the Reverend&nbsp;
Mother Gaius Helen Mohiam has come to know of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.440
Paul’s visions and wants to check if he is&nbsp;
‘the one’ they have been waiting for. 
&nbsp;

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:40.320
She makes him put his hands on a box and test&nbsp;
his impulse control, which he passes with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:45.200
great effort. After Mohiam leaves, Jessica&nbsp;
tells Paul that the female organization,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:49.760
Bene Gesserit, has been steering the politics&nbsp;
for years from the shadows. And they have also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:54.640
been carefully crossing bloodlines in order&nbsp;
to give birth to the one man who will have the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.640 --> 00:05:00.880
potential to save Arrakis from spice exploitation.&nbsp;
It turns out the test Paul just passed shows him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:06.560
to be the one they have been looking for,&nbsp;
The Messiah Of Arrakis. The very next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:12.800
Leto, Paul, Jessica, and their troops leave for&nbsp;
Arrakis and land on the planet. They are welcomed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:20.400
by the native Fremen who have already been told&nbsp;
that Paul is their messiah, although Paul himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:25.120
believes that it is just a superstition. 
Later, he is in his chamber learning about a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:31.920
massive sandworm found in Arrakis. To be safe&nbsp;
from it, the Fremen walk in irregular motions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:36.800
in the sand. As Paul watches holograms,&nbsp;
a deadly insect emerges from a wall&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:41.760
and tries to kill him. But Paul saves&nbsp;
himself at the right time. On investigating,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:45.920
it is found that a Harkonnen soldier has&nbsp;
been hiding in the walls to kill Paul. 
&nbsp;

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:51.440
The scene shifts to Baron meeting Mohiam. She&nbsp;
knows about the emperor and Baron’s plan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:57.200
attack Atreides but cannot do anything because it&nbsp;
is the emperor’s order. However, she asks Baron&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:02.960
not to kill Jessica and Paul. Baron agrees to do&nbsp;
as she says, but plans to throw the two in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:08.480
sand for the sandworms to kill. Back on Arrakis, a&nbsp;
meeting is held where the officials discuss their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:13.600
plan to mine the spices. It is revealed that the&nbsp;
Harkonnens have left them with damaged equipment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.360
setting them up for failure. 
After a while, Paul reunites with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:22.000
Duncan who had been sent to prepare for their&nbsp;
arrival. Duncan says that he has been living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:27.200
with the Fremen in deserts for four weeks. He&nbsp;
tells them all about their ways to survive and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:33.200
also about a Fremen community called Sietch and&nbsp;
their leader Stilgar. Stilgar has also come to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:48.080
meet Leto. Leto offers him to work together&nbsp;
with the Atreides but Stilgar belittles him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:52.400
from taking from their land without any returns&nbsp;
to the people of their land. They separate on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.400 --> 00:07:03.840
good note after Leto promises to never harm the&nbsp;
Sietches. The next day, Leto and his team go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:09.440
inspect the spice sand that they will be mining&nbsp;
from. They meet a Freman and an imperial ecologist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:14.960
named Dr. Liet-Kynes. She checks the integrity&nbsp;
of Leto’s sand suit which is supposed to recycle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:20.960
sweat and urine from a person’s body into drinking&nbsp;
water. While checking Paul’s suit, Kynes notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:26.720
that he knows Fremen’s ways of wearing the suit&nbsp;
despite it being his first time. This makes her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:31.840
think of a prophecy that says their messiah will&nbsp;
know their ways of life despite being from another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:38.000
land. Kynes also believes Paul to be “the one”.
After that, all of them leave to inspect the spice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:43.200
sand. While sightseeing, they see two sandworms&nbsp;
approaching the harvester that mines the spice.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:47.920
It seems to be a usual problem as a carrier is&nbsp;
sent to lift the harvester to get it out of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:53.520
worm’s reach. However, the carrier’s anchor&nbsp;
breaks and it is unable to lift the machine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:58.640
A crew of 21 are inside the harvester who&nbsp;
are about to be attacked by the worms.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:03.440
Leto thinks quickly and orders everyone to get&nbsp;
their aircraft closer to the device and get the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:08.720
crew on board. They land on the sand minutes&nbsp;
before the worm attacks and manage to save the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:15.040
crew. However, Paul sniffs whiffs of spice in the&nbsp;
process and gets a vision. When he returns home,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:19.920
he is still dizzy and the doctor concludes&nbsp;
it as an allergy. However, Paul claims that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:25.360
he saw a Fremen girl in his vision and he knows&nbsp;
it wasn’t just an allergy. He also tells Jessica&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:30.640
that she is pregnant but Jessica dismisses it.
The scene then shifts to the imperial army planet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:36.160
where a battalion is being prepared to attack&nbsp;
Atreides and kill Leto and his family. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:41.200
called the army of Sadukar who are said to be&nbsp;
the deadliest army in the known world. Back in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:46.400
Arrakis, the doctor brings Paul a medicine to help&nbsp;
him with the allergies. But little does Paul know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:51.600
the doctor has made a deal with Baron and the&nbsp;
medicine will make Paul unconscious. Leto and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:57.440
Jessica are also given medicines for their sleep.&nbsp;
Jessica takes it but Leto doesn’t. After a while&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:02.640
the army of Sadukar attacks them. Leto wakes&nbsp;
up and realizes what is happening. But before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:08.000
he can do anything, the doctor hits him with a&nbsp;
dart that slowly makes him unconscious. Outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:13.200
the Sadukar army wreaks havoc in the place&nbsp;
taking the Atreides’s army by surprise. Since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:18.640
the Sadukar is double in number and has several&nbsp;
weapons, they soon overpower the Atreides.
&nbsp;

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:26.400
At the same time, the doctor tells an&nbsp;
injured Leto that Baron has abducted his wife&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:31.360
so he had to do what he says. The doctor then&nbsp;
takes off Leto’s ring to give it to Paul.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:36.320
He also places a poisonous molar tooth in&nbsp;
Leto’s jaw saying that if he bites hard enough,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:45.680
the tooth with secret poisonous gas will kill&nbsp;
everyone around. Meanwhile, the Sadukar army&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:50.640
abducts Paul and Jessica to throw them in the&nbsp;
sand. Paul wakes up in an aircraft with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:55.600
mother gagged and tied beside him. She can use&nbsp;
her power to manipulate people and make them do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.600 --> 00:10:00.960
what they are told. So the two use their powers&nbsp;
and manage to kill their abductors. Paul finds a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:06.800
fremkit placed by the doctor for their help. After&nbsp;
that, they escape in the middle of the desert. 
&nbsp;

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:12.640
In the meantime, an unconscious Leto is taken to&nbsp;
Baron and stripped naked. The doctor asks Baron&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:17.680
to free his wife but he is instead killed&nbsp;
mercilessly. Baron then tells Leto that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:24.160
bloodline will end today. Seeing no way to escape,&nbsp;
Leto bites onto his teeth and lets out a poisonous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.760
gas that kills everyone in the room including&nbsp;
himself. Somewhere else, Paul and Jessica set up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:35.920
a tent using the kit. They also find a note from&nbsp;
the doctor and Leto’s ring. Looking at the ring,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:41.360
the two realize that Leto is dead and cry&nbsp;
mourning his death. The following morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:46.880
Duncan approaches the Fremen Imperial ecologist&nbsp;
kynes, and asks her to help look for Paul and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:52.560
Jessica. Back in Baron’s palace, his soldier come&nbsp;
into the room after the poisonous gas has faded.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:57.680
They are surprised to see that Baron has attached&nbsp;
himself to the ceiling and is somehow safe. 
&nbsp;

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:03.200
At the same time, Paul gets high on the spice in&nbsp;
the sand and starts to get visions of the holy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:08.080
war that is about to happen in the future.&nbsp;
He sees himself killing millions of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:14.000
and the deaths make him hyperventilate. A worried&nbsp;
Jessica calms her son down. Sometime later, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:19.360
wears his father’s ring, taking the title of duke&nbsp;
of Atreides. They are soon found by Duncan who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:24.800
kneels in front of Paul calling him the lord duke.&nbsp;
Then all three of them are taken to a safe place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:29.760
by Kynes. The place they are staying at is an old&nbsp;
ecological station that was supposed to provide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:35.200
flowing water to Arrakis. If the project had been&nbsp;
successful, Arrakis would have been a paradise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:40.160
However, before the project was completed, the&nbsp;
spice was discovered in the sand. Everyone’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:45.280
attention was diverted towards harvesting the&nbsp;
valuable spice and the project was dismissed.
&nbsp;

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:51.200
A while later, the Sadukar army reaches the safe&nbsp;
zone and attacks everyone. Duncan puts his life at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:57.120
risk to save Jessica and Paul. Paul yells at him&nbsp;
to stop because he has seen Duncan’s death in his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.120 --> 00:12:02.960
vision but Duncan stays put to fulfill his duty.&nbsp;
Eventually, he is killed while fighting the army&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:08.800
but Jessica, Paul, and Kynes manage to run away.&nbsp;
Jessica and Paul get on an aircraft that only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:14.240
holds two people. Meanwhile, Kynes asks them to&nbsp;
head south to meet the Fremen who will help them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:19.520
in their cause. She plans to board an aircraft&nbsp;
from another station. The mother and son fly away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:24.880
but Kynes is soon caught by the Sadukar soldiers.&nbsp;
They are about to kill her when she makes rhythmic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:30.400
thumping on the ground. The noise attracts a&nbsp;
sandworm who kills all of them in one go.
&nbsp;

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:34.800
After that, Paul’s aircraft is chased&nbsp;
by two enemy aircraft. Paul enters their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:39.440
vehicle into an aggressive sand storm making&nbsp;
their enemies believe that they are dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:44.320
In the following scene, we see Baron bathing&nbsp;
in medicines to heal the injuries caused by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:52.960
poisonous gas. His nephew Rabban arrives there and&nbsp;
tells him that Leto and his bloodline are dead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:58.320
Finally happy that his enemy house is destroyed,&nbsp;
Baron orders Rabban to continue to harvest the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:04.480
spice and kill all the Fremen. Somewhere else,&nbsp;
Paul and Jessica crash land in the desert but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:10.240
are safe. They change into the desert suit and&nbsp;
start looking for the Fremen to ask them for help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:15.440
Paul had learned about Fremen lives and knows&nbsp;
the way they walk to avoid attracting the worms.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.680
They walk for the whole day throughout which&nbsp;
Paul gets visions of Fremen people and a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:24.880
specific girl telling him to not give up.
The two stop to rest for a while when suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:30.400
they hear a loud noise. Paul realizes that&nbsp;
a sandworm is nearby. To save their lives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:35.760
they start to run only to be chased by the worm&nbsp;
even faster. It emerges from the sand and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:41.200
about to engulf the two but stops midway.&nbsp;
Someone had set off a thumper to help them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:45.440
Just then, the leader of the Fremen&nbsp;
Stilgar, and his group surround them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:50.480
It is soon revealed that they plan to kill Paul&nbsp;
and Jessica for the fluids in their bodies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:55.200
Stilger stops his men saying that Paul is the&nbsp;
messiah they were told about. The others do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:55.200 --> 00:14:00.560
believe him saying that Paul hasn’t yet proven&nbsp;
himself so he cannot be the messiah. One of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:06.080
insults Jessica calling her old and a weakling.&nbsp;
She proves herself by holding the man hostage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:11.840
with his life in her hands. After that, the leader&nbsp;
asks everyone to make their way to the Sietch Tabr&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:16.880
where Paul and Jessica’s fate will be determined.&nbsp;
Just then, the girl from Pauls’ visions arrives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:23.040
in front of him and introduces herself as Chani.&nbsp;
As they prepare to leave, one Fremen named Jamis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:27.520
insists on having a duel with Paul. 
In Fremen’s tradition, all duels must end&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:32.480
with someone’s death. Paul, who has been&nbsp;
training all his life easily defeats Jamis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:37.280
but he hesitates to kill him because he&nbsp;
hasn’t killed anyone in his life. At last,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:42.640
Paul stabs the man to death and wins the fight.&nbsp;
Then, the others pack the dead body and make their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:48.320
way to the Sietch Tabr. The movie ends when&nbsp;
Paul sees a man riding a massive sandworm and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:52.720
Chani tells him it is only the beginning. The&nbsp;
ending of the movie makes it clear that there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:57.600
is much more to come in the sequels. 
